       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "A severe heatwave affected the town of Verlow and the surrounding province from 23 June 2026.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "Heat and load shedding strained the electricity network, and the Marnest substation was destroyed.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "Injuries were confirmed in Verlow and deaths were attributed to the heatwave and the warning period.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "The Provincial Public Health Institute and Grennet Power deployed and issued warnings while dangerous conditions persisted at Hetton Rise and Camber Green.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
